hajimariwa</span><span begin="05:19.502" end="05:21.353">aoi</span><span begin="05:21.353" end="05:23.239">iro</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="05:32.132"><div begin="00:11.659" end="05:23.239"><p begin="00:11.659" end="00:16.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:11.659" end="00:12.763">袖丈</span><span begin="00:12.763" end="00:13.147">が</span><span begin="00:13.147" end="00:14.432">覚束ない</span><span begin="00:14.432" end="00:15.438">夏の</span><span begin="00:15.880" end="00:16.394">終わ</span><span begin="00:16.394" end="00:16.963">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">长袖短袖没有定数的夏末时节</span></p><p begin="00:17.634" end="00:23.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:17.634" end="00:18.691">明け方</span><span begin="00:18.691" end="00:19.091">の</span><span begin="00:19.091" end="00:20.075">電車に</span><span begin="00:20.075" end="00:21.351">揺られて</span><span begin="00:21.577" end="00:22.718">思い</span><span begin="00:22.718" end="00:23.241">出し</span><span begin="00:23.241" end="00:23.941">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黎明时分随着电车而摇晃的我</span></p><p begin="00:24.307" end="00:28.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:24.307" end="00:26.121">懐かしい</span><span begin="00:26.121" end="00:26.886">あの</span><span begin="00:26.886" end="00:28.783">風景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那片令人怀念的风景</span></p><p begin="00:30.959" end="00:36.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:30.959" end="00:32.058">たくさん</span><span begin="00:32.058" end="00:32.407">の</span><span begin="00:32.407" end="00:33.335">遠回り</span><span begin="00:33.335" end="00:33.715">を</span><span begin="00:33.715" end="00:34.292">繰り</span><span begin="00:34.292" end="00:35.243">返</span><span begin="00:35.243" end="00:35.474">し</span><span begin="00:35.474" end="00:36.160">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反复绕过许多远路</span></p><p begin="00:36.909" end="00:43.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:36.909" end="00:37.853">同じ</span><span begin="00:37.853" end="00:38.403">ような</span><span begin="00:38.403" end="00:39.787">街並みが</span><span begin="00:39.787" end="00:40.433">ただ</span><span begin="00:40.888" end="00:41.937">通り</span><span begin="00:41.937" end="00:42.559">過ぎ</span><span begin="00:42.559" end="00:43.202">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">千篇一律的街景</span></p><p begin="00:43.549" end="00:48.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:43.549" end="00:44.640">窓に</span><span begin="00:44.640" end="00:45.789">僕が</span><span begin="00:45.789" end="00:47.256">映っ</span><span begin="00:47.256" end="00:47.421">て</span><span begin="00:47.421" end="00:48.210">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">车窗上倒映着我的影子</span></p><p begin="00:49.855" end="00:54.615" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:49.855" end="00:50.970">君は今も</span><span begin="00:51.292" end="00:52.774">あの頃みたいに</span><span begin="00:52.774" end="00:53.873">いるのだろう</span><span begin="00:53.873" end="00:54.615">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今你是否还同那时一样</span></p><p begin="00:55.772" end="01:00.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:55.772" end="00:57.251">ひしゃげて曲がった</span><span begin="00:57.251" end="00:58.750">あの自転車で</span><span begin="00:58.750" end="00:59.835">走り回っ</span><span begin="00:59.835" end="01:00.504">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">骑着轮框变形的自行车</span></p><p begin="01:01.737" end="01:07.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:01.737" end="01:02.388">馬鹿ばか</span><span begin="01:02.388" end="01:03.188">しい</span><span begin="01:03.188" end="01:03.884">綱渡</span><span begin="01:03.884" end="01:04.325">り</span> <span begin="01:04.617" end="01:05.194">膝に</span><span begin="01:05.614" end="01:06.886">滲んだ</span><span begin="01:06.886" end="01:07.616">血</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当年那些傻傻的冒险</span></p><p begin="01:07.656" end="01:13.688" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:07.656" end="01:08.415">今はな</span><span begin="01:08.415" end="01:10.255">んだか</span><span begin="01:10.532" end="01:11.065">ひどく</span><span begin="01:11.065" end="01:13.688">虚しい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今想来感觉十分不真实</span></p><p begin="01:17.604" end="01:23.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:17.604" end="01:18.534">どれだ</span><span begin="01:18.534" end="01:19.612">け</span><span begin="01:19.801" end="01:21.378">背丈が</span><span begin="01:21.378" end="01:22.036">変わ</span><span begin="01:22.036" end="01:22.651">ろう</span><span begin="01:22.651" end="01:22.908">と</span><span begin="01:22.908" end="01:23.540">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论身高如何变化</span></p><p begin="01:23.556" end="01:29.618" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:23.556" end="01:24.457">変わら</span><span begin="01:24.457" end="01:25.708">ない</span><span begin="01:25.708" end="01:26.473">何</span><span begin="01:26.473" end="01:27.191">かが</span><span begin="01:27.191" end="01:27.940">あり</span><span begin="01:27.940" end="01:28.667">ます</span><span begin="01:28.667" end="01:28.956">よう</span><span begin="01:28.956" end="01:29.618">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也希望</span></p><p begin="01:29.630" end="01:35.465" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:29.630" end="01:30.361">くだら</span><span begin="01:30.361" end="01:31.681">ない</span><span begin="01:31.681" end="01:33.329">面影に</span><span begin="01:33.329" end="01:34.145">励</span><span begin="01:34.145" end="01:34.652">まさ</span><span begin="01:34.652" end="01:35.465">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被旧时蠢蠢的模样激励着</span></p><p begin="01:35.802" end="01:40.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:35.802" end="01:36.350">今も</span><span begin="01:36.350" end="01:37.235">歌う</span><span begin="01:37.235" end="01:37.867">今も</span><span begin="01:37.867" end="01:38.718">歌う</span><span begin="01:38.718" end="01:39.286">今も</span><span begin="01:39.286" end="01:40.680">歌う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今仍要歌唱 歌唱 歌唱</span></p><p begin="01:41.707" end="01:46.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:41.707" end="01:42.372">Lalala</span><span begin="01:42.372" end="01:43.156">la</span> <span begin="01:43.156" end="01:43.854">lalala</span><span begin="01:43.854" end="01:44.622">la</span> <span begin="01:44.622" end="01:45.305">lalala</span><span begin="01:45.305" end="01:46.787">la</span></p><p begin="01:59.842" end="02:05.428" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:59.842" end="02:00.274">忙</span><span begin="02:00.274" end="02:00.807">し</span><span begin="02:00.807" end="02:01.509">なく</span><span begin="02:01.509" end="02:02.341">街を</span><span begin="02:02.341" end="02:03.141">走る</span><span begin="02:03.141" end="02:03.985">タ</span><span begin="02:03.985" end="02:04.491">クシー</span><span begin="02:04.491" end="02:05.428">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心不在焉地乘着</span></p><p begin="02:05.786" end="02:12.158" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:05.786" end="02:06.301">ぼん</span><span begin="02:06.301" end="02:06.752">や</span><span begin="02:06.752" end="02:07.131">りと</span><span begin="02:07.434" end="02:08.034">背負</span><span begin="02:08.034" end="02:08.701">われた</span><span begin="02:08.701" end="02:09.474">まま</span><span begin="02:09.786" end="02:10.765">くしゃみ</span><span begin="02:10.765" end="02:11.519">をし</span><span begin="02:11.519" end="02:12.158">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿梭在繁忙城市间的出租车</span></p><p begin="02:12.440" end="02:17.312" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:12.440" end="02:13.528">窓の</span><span begin="02:13.528" end="02:14.661">外を</span><span begin="02:14.661" end="02:16.098">眺</span><span begin="02:16.098" end="02:16.346">め</span><span begin="02:16.346" end="02:17.312">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眺望车窗外的景色</span></p><p begin="02:19.105" end="02:24.427" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:19.105" end="02:20.071">心</span><span begin="02:20.071" end="02:20.674">から</span><span begin="02:20.773" end="02:21.839">震えた</span><span begin="02:21.839" end="02:22.423">あの</span><span begin="02:22.423" end="02:23.671">瞬間</span><span begin="02:23.671" end="02:24.427">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深深期盼着</span></p><p begin="02:24.997" end="02:31.341" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:24.997" end="02:25.460">もう</span><span begin="02:25.460" end="02:26.508">一度</span><span begin="02:26.695" end="02:27.412">出会え</span><span begin="02:27.412" end="02:27.983">たら</span><span begin="02:27.983" end="02:28.764">いいと</span><span begin="02:29.060" end="02:30.196">強く</span><span begin="02:30.196" end="02:30.796">思</span><span begin="02:30.796" end="02:31.341">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能在内心悸动的瞬间</span></p><p begin="02:31.690" end="02:36.395" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:31.690" end="02:33.122">忘れる</span><span begin="02:33.122" end="02:34.287">ことは</span><span begin="02:34.287" end="02:35.217">な</span><span begin="02:35.217" end="02:35.621">いん</span><span begin="02:35.621" end="02:36.395">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未忘记过你</span></p><p begin="02:38.000" end="02:42.739" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:38.000" end="02:38.590">君は</span><span begin="02:38.590" end="02:39.200">今も</span><span begin="02:39.506" end="02:40.223">あの頃</span><span begin="02:40.223" end="02:40.973">みたいに</span><span begin="02:40.973" end="02:41.490">いるの</span><span begin="02:41.490" end="02:42.055">だろう</span><span begin="02:42.055" end="02:42.739">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今你是否还同那时一样</span></p><p begin="02:43.953" end="02:48.524" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:43.953" end="02:44.533">靴を</span><span begin="02:44.533" end="02:45.240">片方</span><span begin="02:45.435" end="02:46.149">茂みに</span><span begin="02:46.149" end="02:46.867">落として</span><span begin="02:46.867" end="02:47.451">探し</span><span begin="02:47.451" end="02:47.984">回っ</span><span begin="02:47.984" end="02:48.524">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一只鞋落在了茂密的草木中</span></p><p begin="02:49.853" end="02:55.482" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:49.853" end="02:50.450">「何が</span><span begin="02:50.450" end="02:51.587">あろうと</span><span begin="02:51.587" end="02:52.301">僕らは</span><span begin="02:52.805" end="02:53.528">きっと</span><span begin="02:53.869" end="02:54.675">上手く</span><span begin="02:54.675" end="02:55.024">いく」</span><span begin="02:55.024" end="02:55.482">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“无论发生什么</span></p><p begin="02:55.800" end="03:01.970" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:55.800" end="02:56.522">無邪気に</span><span begin="02:56.522" end="02:57.639">笑</span><span begin="02:57.639" end="02:57.820">え</span><span begin="02:57.820" end="02:58.599">た</span> <span begin="02:58.754" end="02:59.255">日々を</span><span begin="02:59.255" end="02:59.989">憶</span><span begin="02:59.989" end="03:00.804">えて</span><span begin="03:00.804" end="03:01.046">い</span><span begin="03:01.046" end="03:01.970">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还牢牢记得</span></p><p begin="03:05.780" end="03:11.590" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="03:05.780" end="03:06.690">どれだ</span><span begin="03:06.690" end="03:07.635">け</span><span begin="03:08.005" end="03:09.471">無様に</span><span begin="03:09.471" end="03:10.223">傷</span><span begin="03:10.223" end="03:10.957">つこうと</span><span begin="03:10.957" end="03:11.590">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论如何遍体鳞伤</span></p><p begin="03:11.706" end="03:17.651" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="03:11.706" end="03:12.608">終わら</span><span begin="03:12.608" end="03:13.614">ない</span><span begin="03:13.891" end="03:15.608">毎日に</span><span begin="03:15.608" end="03:17.075">花束</span><span begin="03:17.075" end="03:17.651">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要为永无止境的每一天献上花束</span></p><p begin="03:17.853" end="03:23.421" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="03:17.853" end="03:18.564">くだら</span><span begin="03:18.564" end="03:19.440">ない</span><span begin="03:19.799" end="03:21.289">面影</span><span begin="03:21.289" end="03:21.533">を</span><span begin="03:21.533" end="03:22.215">追い</span><span begin="03:22.215" end="03:22.783">かけ</span><span begin="03:22.783" end="03:23.421">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐着旧时蠢蠢的模样</span></p><p begin="03:23.906" end="03:28.610" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="03:23.906" end="03:24.412">今も</span><span begin="03:24.412" end="03:25.414">歌う</span><span begin="03:25.414" end="03:26.014">今も</span><span begin="03:26.014" end="03:26.913">歌う</span><span begin="03:26.913" end="03:27.446">今も</span><span begin="03:27.446" end="03:28.610">歌う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今仍要歌唱 歌唱 歌唱</span></p><p begin="03:29.837" end="03:34.515" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="03:29.837" end="03:30.635">Lalala</span><span begin="03:30.635" end="03:31.334">la</span> <span begin="03:31.334" end="03:32.086">lalala</span><span begin="03:32.086" end="03:32.851">la</span> <span begin="03:32.851" end="03:33.518">lalala</span><span begin="03:33.518" end="03:34.515">la</span></p><p begin="03:36.146" end="03:41.732" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:36.146" end="03:37.047">朝日が</span><span begin="03:37.047" end="03:37.965">昇る</span><span begin="03:37.965" end="03:39.079">前の</span><span begin="03:39.079" end="03:39.580">欠</span><span begin="03:39.580" end="03:40.233">け</span><span begin="03:40.233" end="03:40.582">た</span><span begin="03:40